01:26:02.958 --> 01:26:04.157
STEPHEN QUADROS:
<i> And there it is,</i>

01:26:04.259 --> 01:26:06.619
<i> another decisive victory</i>
<i> from Igor Vovchanchyn</i>

01:26:06.721 --> 01:26:08.962
<i> as he moves on to</i>
<i> the final round.</i>

01:26:09.064 --> 01:26:11.324
